Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.25,0:06:15.05,hmz,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fs14\pos(180,181)}小田原
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.25,0:06:15.05,hmz,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fs14\pos(168,204)}區劃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.25,0:06:15.05,hmz,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fs13\pos(162,227)}安全地區/無怪物出沒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.25,0:06:15.05,hmz,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fs14\pos(167,240)}其他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.25,0:06:15.05,hmz,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fs14\pos(256,252)}禁止戰鬥區域
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.25,0:06:15.05,hmz,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fs14\pos(251,271)}有特技限制
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.41,0:13:04.91,hmz,,0,0,0,,{\fs26\1c&H00DCE091\pos(655,63)}密語中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:04.91,hmz,,0,0,0,,{\fs24\pos(392,209)}城惠
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:04.91,hmz,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(345,284)}所屬公會
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:04.91,hmz,,0,0,0,,{\fs19\pos(468,289)}記錄的地平線 公會會長
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:04.91,hmz,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(374,326)}接通
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:04.91,hmz,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(502,324)}掛斷
